.TH PSReluS 3 2023-12-07 "PsyC 0.9.3" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
PSReluS

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/activation.h>

.I
PSFloat  
.br
\fBPSReluS\fR(\fIPSFloat val\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
ReLU (Rectified Linear Unit) activation function for scalars.
.br
It takes the scalar \fIval\fR as argument and returns a \fIPFloat\fR scalar.
.br
For info about ReLU:
.br
  \fIhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rectifier_(neural_networks\fR)
.br
The equivalent function to be used with vectors/matrices is \fIPSRelu\fR.
.br
The derivative of this function is \fIPSReluDerivativeS\fR.  

.SH RETURN VALUES
ReLU scalar result.

.SH SEE ALSO
PSRelu(3), PSReluDerivativeS(3)
